msgid "Fikringizni yozing..."
msgstr "Write your feedback..."

msgid "Ixtiyoriy — bo'sh qoldirsangiz 'Anonim' deb ko'rsatiladi."
msgstr "Optional — if left blank, it will be shown as 'Anonymous'."

msgid "Ismingiz (ixtiyoriy)"
msgstr "Your name (optional)"

msgid "Izoh"
msgstr "Comment"

msgid "Izohingizni yozing…"
msgstr "Write your comment…"

msgid "Spam aniqlandi."
msgstr "Spam detected."

msgid "Izoh bo'sh bo'lishi mumkin emas."
msgstr "Comment cannot be empty."

msgid "Email (ixtiyoriy)"
msgstr "Email (optional)"

msgid "Bu foydalanuvchi nomi allaqachon band. Boshqa nom tanlang."
msgstr "This username is already taken. Please choose another."

msgid "Foydalanuvchi nomini kiriting."
msgstr "Please enter a username."

msgid ""
"Foydalanuvchi nomida faqat harflar, raqamlar va @/./+/-/_ belgilaridan "
"foydalaning."
msgstr "Username may only contain letters, digits and @/./+/-/_ characters."

msgid "Savolingizni yozing..."
msgstr "Write your question..."

msgid "Hisobga kirish"
msgstr "Log in to your account"

msgid "Hisobingizga kirib, maqolalarga izoh qoldiring."
msgstr "Log in to your account to leave comments on articles."

msgid "Foydalanuvchi nomi"
msgstr "Username"

msgid "Parol"
msgstr "Password"

msgid "Parolni ko'rsatish"
msgstr "Show password"

msgid "Hisobingiz yo‘qmi?"
msgstr "Don't have an account?"

msgid "Ro‘yxatdan o‘ting"
msgstr "Sign up"

msgid "Saytda ishtirok etish uchun yangi hisob yarating."
msgstr "Create a new account to participate on the site."

msgid "Email"
msgstr "Email"

msgid "ixtiyoriy"
msgstr "optional"

msgid "Parolni tasdiqlang"
msgstr "Confirm password"

msgid "Hisobingiz bormi?"
msgstr "Already have an account?"

msgid "Noto'g'ri so'rov"
msgstr "Bad Request"

msgid ""
"Kechirasiz, so'rovingiz noto'g'ri yoki tushunarsiz formatda yuborildi. "
"Sahifani qayta yuklab ko'ring yoki bosh sahifaga qayting."
msgstr ""
"Sorry, your request was sent in an invalid or unrecognized format. Please "
"reload the page or return to the homepage."

msgid "Bosh sahifaga qaytish"
msgstr "Return to homepage"

msgid "403 — Ruxsat berilmagan"
msgstr "403 — Access Denied"

msgid "Ruxsat berilmagan"
msgstr "Access Denied"

msgid ""
"Kechirasiz, sizda ushbu sahifani ko'rish uchun yetarli huquq yo'q. Agar bu "
"xato deb hisoblasangiz, tizimga qayta kiring yoki administrator bilan "
"bog'laning."
msgstr ""
"Sorry, you do not have sufficient permission to view this page. If you "
"believe this is an error, please log in again or contact the administrator."

msgid "404 — Sahifa topilmadi"
msgstr "404 — Page Not Found"

msgid "Sahifa topilmadi"
msgstr "Page Not Found"

msgid ""
"Kechirasiz, siz izlagan sahifa mavjud emas yoki o'chirib yuborilgan bo'lishi"
" mumkin. Havolani tekshirib qayta urinib ko'ring yoki bosh sahifaga qayting."
msgstr ""
"Sorry, the page you are looking for does not exist or may have been removed."
" Please check the link and try again, or return to the homepage."

msgid "500 — Server xatosi"
msgstr "500 — Server Error"

msgid "Serverda texnik nosozlik"
msgstr "Server Technical Issue"

msgid ""
"Kechirasiz, hozircha texnik nosozlik yuz berdi. Bizning mutaxassislar "
"muammoni tezda bartaraf etishga harakat qilmoqda. Iltimos, birozdan so'ng "
"qayta urinib ko'ring."
msgstr ""
"Sorry, a technical issue has occurred. Our specialists are working to "
"resolve it quickly. Please try again shortly."
